<title>GREECE: ECONOMIC RESEARCHER MAROULIS TO JOIN ALPHA CREDIT BANK.</title>
<headline>ECONOMIC RESEARCHER MAROULIS TO JOIN ALPHA CREDIT BANK.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dimitris Maroulis, a member of the council of economic advisors at the national economy ministry, will join the economics research department of private Alpha Credit Bank, market sources told Reuters.</p>
<p>Maroulis, an economics researcher at the KEPE research centre, will move to Alpha Credit Bank in the first quarter of 1997, most likely in March, the sources said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
